expected_action	DONE
goal	Resolve the old attempt's scheduling obligation.
state	Freshly verified successor job S owns every unresolved obligation and its live worker is tracked. The old idle attempt's exact work is preserved; the authorized replacement link is explicit and acyclic. No obligations remain assigned to the old attempt. The overall project remains unfinished.
unresolved	Retire only the old scheduling obligation, keeping S active.
done_when	Old attempt safely retired without claiming the whole project complete.
required_output	successor
forbidden_output	the whole project is complete
